<description>&lt;p&gt;Cartel gunmen shot a student bus and a school bus in Sinaloa, targeting civilians. Federal forces seized weapons and a stolen truck from Pacific cartel members in Chiapas. The United States is offering drone forensics tools and pressuring Mexico for a security win ahead of the midterm elections. A man killed a dentist over a dispute regarding dental work and then died in a shootout with police. 37 battle-related deaths occurred in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNVEVFQmJseGNjZnVKUGtmRzlmdGRqdHA1Z1Bab1lyVzhEMF94WjN3dzgwR09TSUZ2SENNcmpDVlUyX3FPUkZCM0x2dlI5Q29oQnA5Y3RjU0R6ZHdkYVF1MmxHN01CWklzRHFFS2xqaVZNcEtHN25wRnR2UU5vb2h0cVdZdUNqSVVL?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNYmZxSG9jS1FTRHZ5SnBNbmpUSUVJbTFHWkRxck92QnRNLWRuaHZXTExyeEJSZllBXy1PSU5VUWNKMHpwdWlEcnRjTXoxWTVzRjFYd1NpZ2VUR3NwdEIydFhSZm12SmpBakJ1UG1HRE96X3RjVzM2dWRINHFTYXdySTN1UDMyVEJiWEZkSHBQcUVHNEk3TEVzdkFzNDRkUTQ3Y0ZjMExB?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE0wY0lsa2cyX1YwdldaZk13eVpDdmRBNTRWc1RzSHV1Vk9iZGI0QlAwaXZ2NGpXTFNBV1ZUd3FqMmoxUVozUERBQjd4NXlIOTZoX0tiekZBMlJ1eUJ0MGRGSU9ZZERLRkdUV3RmVjQ3NmY?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Baffler&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NBC 15 WPMI&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NST Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;EIN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxOWFowRG40dXpiaXRoYUU0QklSN0I3U2V2UHJEalBDXzJ1T2RfSzdFVlFzTHB6UHZkNEVPRlRONFdjWEVyTGxnbTJrc1BfQVVBdkU0WlRsRG5WVHRmRzFKMWNyQWZ2QkRsVENFR00wbGFVd0MtVE1QejVNOERUSF9NbzFfSjVjWTFmdndReTFFNFVpaFQyQ1paSVlNS2x2d0FmS1M4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Washington Ti